# Mood Taster

Mood Taster matches how you feel to what you should taste — food, drink, or recipes — without diet dogma or endless menus.

## Product stance

- Start from mood, not menus or macros
- Recommendations should feel human, brief, and actionable
- Prefer explainable picks ("why this fits") over black-box scores
- Not a therapist, delivery service, or calorie counter

## Visual stance

- Two tones (ink + paper) and one saffron accent — nothing else
- Flat and spacing-led: no gradients, borders, or shadows
- Full system in `design-system.mdc`

## Agent defaults

- Prefer small, focused changes over broad rewrites
- Match existing patterns before introducing new ones
- Do not commit or push unless explicitly asked
- Keep secrets out of the repo; use env examples only
- Update docs when APIs, schema, or IA change materially
- Production site is on Vercel (`https://mood-taster.vercel.app/`)
